trol: Fixed – predefined configurations managed by our team (e.g. full site, category, etc.)\"},{\"sort\":8,\"text\":\"Quality Assurance: Standardized – pre-defined by schema\"},{\"sort\":9,\"text\":\"Legal and GDPR: Compliance review included\"}],\"name\":\"features\",\"type\":\"list\",\"handle\":\"features\",\"help_text\":\"2 rendering options: 1) \\\"Some feature description...\\\" (will render as it is) \u0026 2) \\\"Feature title: feature description\\\" (will render Feature title in semibold). Just use the semicolon in case you want the second.\"},\"description\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBCwwVrbJwH38SDw6f3nJrNm\",\"name\":\"description\",\"text\":\"For data types supported by AI Scraping\",\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"description\",\"help_text\":null},\"highlighted\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBCwxAFM1qBWHYwHHWPm3Dky\",\"name\":\"highlighted\",\"type\":\"toggle\",\"is_on\":false,\"handle\":\"highlighted\",\"help_text\":null},\"price_amount\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBcWZs7pGjJZCRF6a7kVtWbY\",\"name\":\"pricing_amount\",\"text\":\"$$500\",\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"price_amount\",\"help_text\":null},\"pricing_period\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBcX01Hw4GbfQNghgxXf0979\",\"name\":\"pricing_period\",\"text\":\"per month\",\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"pricing_period\",\"help_text\":null},\"highlighted_text\":{\"id\":\"f_01KbcwxJpc7vcxW9wZcSdCFE7B\",\"name\":\"highlightedText\",\"text\":null,\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"highlighted_text\",\"help_text\":null}},\"content_type\":{\"id\":\"ct_01KbCwTWW6CHXTM0978Qd9W3rw\",\"name\":\"pricing_card_new\",\"handle\":\"pricing_card_new\",\"object_type\":\"block\"}},{\"name\":\"\",\"sort\":1,\"fields\":{\"link\":{\"id\":\"f_01kbCwYQ67b8bV6R92pfgh7qH8\",\"name\":\"cta\",\"type\":\"blocks\",\"blocks\":[],\"handle\":\"link\",\"help_text\":null},\"name\":{\"id\":\"f_01KbCWW56y9b2hbDwv56kCtaFn\",\"name\":\"name\",\"text\":\"Custom\",\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"name\",\"help_text\":null},\"features\":{\"id\":\"f_01kbcx350Dyt7J9S816TCEXkAK\",\"list\":[{\"sort\":0,\"text\":\"Setup Costs: From $100 - depending on project complexity\"},{\"sort\":1,\"text\":\"Schema: Fully Customizable – tailored to your specific data needs\"},{\"sort\":2,\"text\":\"Crawl Frequency: Flexible – schedule as per your project needs\"},{\"sort\":3,\"text\":\"Delivery: Delivered to your preferred cloud platform (e.g., AWS, Google Cloud, Azure)\"},{\"sort\":4,\"text\":\"Format: JSON, CSV, XML, or other formats\"},{\"sort\":5,\"text\":\"Post-Processing: Included – advanced post-processing options like data deduplication, matching, etc.\"},{\"sort\":6,\"text\":\"Service Level Agreement: 24/7 Enterprise Support with fast response times (within 1 hour for critical issues)\"},{\"sort\":7,\"text\":\"Crawl Control: Full control over crawl configurations (e.g., rules, schedule, site prioritization)\"},{\"sort\":8,\"text\":\"Quality Assurance: Client specific benchmarks (e.g. precision, recall)\"},{\"sort\":9,\"text\":\"Legal and GDPR: Compliance review included\"}],\"name\":\"features\",\"type\":\"list\",\"handle\":\"features\",\"help_text\":\"2 rendering options: 1) \\\"Some feature description...\\\" (will render as it is) \u0026 2) \\\"Feature title: feature description\\\" (will render Feature title in semibold). Just use the semicolon in case you want the second.\"},\"description\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBCwwVrbJwH38SDw6f3nJrNm\",\"name\":\"description\",\"text\":\"Tailored to your specific data needs\",\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"description\",\"help_text\":null},\"highlighted\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBCwxAFM1qBWHYwHHWPm3Dky\",\"name\":\"highlighted\",\"type\":\"toggle\",\"is_on\":true,\"handle\":\"highlighted\",\"help_text\":null},\"price_amount\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBcWZs7pGjJZCRF6a7kVtWbY\",\"name\":\"pricing_amount\",\"text\":\"$$1,000\",\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"price_amount\",\"help_text\":null},\"pricing_period\":{\"id\":\"f_01KBcX01Hw4GbfQNghgxXf0979\",\"name\":\"pricing_period\",\"text\":\"per month\",\"type\":\"text\",\"handle\":\"pricing_period\",\"help_t